  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So controller drift has been a quite mainstream problem for many VR users with different VR controllers for a good while. This issue makes it very frustrating to navigate through the action menu and main menu when trying to join someone, look for worlds or change settings since the menu keeps infinitely scrolling (in my case downwards) when you're pointing the laser at it. It would be incredibly useful to be able to disable scrolling through the menu using thumbsticks. That way we could easily navigate through a menu by dragging it while holding down the trigger or just using the scrollbar.",
